      "text": "In 104 of 178 countries and territories, agriculture consumes the majority of freshwater withdrawals."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.71575,
      "end": 17.04075,
      "text": "Somalia: 99.5%. Afghanistan: 98.2%. Nepal: 98.1%."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.04075,
      "end": 24.190749999999998,
      "text": "Somalia takes 7.1 times the water that goes to farming in the UK, which uses 14.0%."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.190749999999998,
      "end": 30.665749999999996,
      "text": "The United States uses 39.7%. China is 62.1%."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.665749999999996,
      "end": 34.89075,
      "text": "India hits 90.4% for irrigation and livestock."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.89075,
